  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "One Idea that I've felt for a long time would be fun to add is a global PVP system. This wouldn't be anything serious, but would simply result in your avatar playing the death animation if they are hit enough times with a dedicated weapon, as long as they have their weapon out at the same time. \nThe main draw for this would be light RP or to add a fun dynamic.\nThe way it would work in my head is;\nAll users have an inventory item that is a game given weapon. When they have it active, only then do they have hitpoints active as well. This prevents people from randomly attacking others. There is no point system or anything. It simply is visual and just triggers the death animation.\nSince these weapons would be game given, vrchat plus users may be able to use reskinned versions of the same weapons",
